	Section:
		Text: Values
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Gradients
		Paragraph: A background can be `linear(angle, color, color...)`. The angle is in degrees: `0` goes from bottom to top, `90` from left to right and `180` from top to bottom. The colors are spread out evenly and can carry opacity.
